<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Insignia Financial raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Insignia Financial raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs analyst Richard Moore upgraded Insignia Financial Group Inc to trading buy from market outperformer, his office said.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1/4 at 17-3/8.</p>
</text>
